flowchart LR
    A[Raw data<br/>S3] --> B[Clean + dedupe<br/>Glue / Lambda]
    B --> C[Quality filter<br/>toxicity, PII scrub]
    C --> D[Tokenize<br/>provider tokenizer]
    D --> E[Train / val split]
    E --> F[Fine-tune job<br/>Bedrock]
    F --> G[Evaluate]
    G -->|Regress| B
    G -->|Pass| H[Custom model<br/>provisioned]
